{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"pose artifact-check --help; pose surface-check --help; git diff --stat d724738b53a8fe94ec9b2eb749a5242958f06d4a 2b2eaede613ef2f1eb778acd07f9fa58e7f33cf6; rg -n 'TODO|FIXME|stub|panic' pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view_stream.go pose-mcp/internal/cli/change_set_streamed_digest_test.go pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view_stream_test.go; cmp POSE.md pose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/POSE.md; cmp locales/pt-BR/POSE.md pose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/locales/pt-BR/POSE.md\"","aggregated_output":"POSE - artifact-check\n\nReconcile declared spec artifacts with immutable Git changesets\n\nUsage:\n  pose artifact-check --spec <slug> [--from <rev> --to <rev>] [--strict|--tolerant] [--json]\n\nDescription:\n  Verifies that all files declared in section 3 (Technical Plan -> Artifacts) match the actual Git change set attributed to the spec trailer (POSE-Spec: <slug>).\n\nOptions / Flags:\n  --spec <slug>            Specification slug to reconcile\n  --from <rev>             Starting git revision for change set comparison\n  --to <rev>               Ending git revision for change set comparison\n  --strict                 Fail on any undeclared or missing artifact mismatch\n  --json                   Output reconciliation results in JSON format\n\nExamples:\n  $ pose artifact-check --spec user-auth --strict\n\nPOSE - surface-check\n\nProve composition and reachability of delivered UI surfaces and capabilities\n\nUsage:\n  pose surface-check [--spec <slug>] [--results <path>] [--strict|--tolerant] [--json]\n\nDescription:\n  Validates that delivered surfaces, contracts, and capabilities are reachable from production entrypoints with fresh typed validation evidence.\n\nOptions / Flags:\n  --spec <slug>            Filter check to delivery targets of a specific spec\n  --results <path>         Path to validation results JSON (default: .pose/results/delivery-validation.json)\n  --strict                 Fail on unreached surfaces or missing validation evidence\n\nExamples:\n  $ pose surface-check --spec dashboard-ui --strict\n\n ...nce-reads-use-bounded-operation-scoped-views.md |    21 +\n ...pec-pose-read-view-streamed-object-digests.json |     8 +\n .pose/indexes/delivery-integrity.json              | 10858 ++++++++++---------\n .pose/indexes/generation.json                      |    18 +-\n .pose/indexes/spec-graph.json                      |  1162 +-\n .pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json               |     7 +\n .pose/results/delivery-validation.json             |  1622 +--\n .../23656b7368a4ad037ffca1fa/000001.json           |    11 +\n .../23656b7368a4ad037ffca1fa/000001.result.json    |     6 +\n .../bc827980f39d9039f5379bb4/000001.json           |    11 +\n .../bc827980f39d9039f5379bb4/000001.result.json    |     6 +\n .../review-attestations/rva-1b6c58b4789579b9.json  |   224 +\n .../review-attestations/rva-cc738d59d98c6236.json  |   248 +\n .pose/review-bundles/rvb-3f6bb2de81f702e1.json     |  3289 ++++++\n .pose/review-bundles/rvb-5364a11b6d7e041d.json     |  3344 ++++++\n .pose/review-conclusions/rrn-9f3099633e340afb.json |    13 +\n .pose/review-conclusions/rrn-c2966cb8e4ff258c.json |    13 +\n .pose/review-run-ledger/rrn-9f3099633e340afb.json  |     8 +\n .pose/review-run-ledger/rrn-c2966cb8e4ff258c.json  |     8 +\n ...dd704d8de097178ac26c48657a5d35b8f9ccc2c4ad.json |    23 +\n ...8dd6e47ef82e299b6ff4ff5a3e6ed3ffc29fe2a7d9.json |    23 +\n .../review-runs/rrn-9f3099633e340afb.events.ndjson |    61 +\n .pose/review-runs/rrn-9f3099633e340afb.json        |   136 +\n .pose/review-runs/rrn-9f3099633e340afb.transcript  |    62 +\n .../review-runs/rrn-c2966cb8e4ff258c.events.ndjson |    51 +\n .pose/review-runs/rrn-c2966cb8e4ff258c.json        |   142 +\n .pose/review-runs/rrn-c2966cb8e4ff258c.transcript  |    52 +\n ...11-14-pose-read-view-streamed-object-digests.md |   194 +\n .../pose-read-view-streamed-object-di